<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Veece Instruments.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Veece Instruments.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group Inc said analyst Erach Desai increased his 1997 earnings view on Veeco Instruments Inc to $1.50 a share from $1.48 a share. Raised the 1998 estimate to $1.85 a share from $1.75 a share.</p>
<p>-- said raised the six-month price target to $37 a share from $32 a share.</p>
<p>-- ratings remain unchanged at short-term and long-term buys.</p>
<p>-- Veeco lost 3/4 to 27-3/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
